          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya sabaa ya mwezi wa mwandzo wa mwaka wa kumi na mwenga bada ya kutsamizwa kpwa lazima, Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, nikavundza mkpwono wa Farao, mfalume wa Misiri na lola, taukafungbwa bendeji ili uphole wala kufungbwa mbamba ili ukale na mkpwotse tsona wa kugbwira upanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Lola, mimi ni chinyume na Farao, mfalume wa Misiri nami ndamvundza mkpwonowe mzima piya ili mikonoye yosi ikale ikavundzika na nihende nyo upanga ugbwe kula mwakpwe mkpwononi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindaatsamula Amisiri kahi za mataifa na kuatsamula tsi mbali-mbali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ndautiya mkpwotse mkpwono wa mfalume wa Babeli na nitiye upanga wangu mwakpwe mkpwononi. Ela mikono ya Farao ndaivundza, naye andaula mbere za Nebukadineza dza mutu achiyelumizwa sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindaitiya nguvu yo mikono ya mfalume wa Babeli, ela mikono ya Farao indarejera. Ndipho aho andamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiphotiya upanga wangu mkpwononi mwa mfalume wa Babeli, naye andaugolosa chinyume cha tsi ya Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami ndaatsamula Amisiri kahi za mataifa ganjina na kuatsamula tsi mbali-mbali. Chisha aho andamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
